|~ The verbs of links. Each resides on `::qlang/link`, the kind of a
   query a page names for its reader to follow. ~|

:open
  |~~ The answer of the query the link holds, run as it stands: a link
      opens to the page or the value it names, so `links * open` reads
      every page a page names in one query.

      ~(|~~ ::link~(1 | add 1) ~~| | links | first | open | eq 2)
      ~(::qlang | doc | links * open | filter ~(type | eq ::doc) | count | gt 0)
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:subject ::any | ::builtin{:impl :qlang/prim/linkOpen})
